    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "The mass $M$ grams of a radioactive sample after $t$ days is given by $M=80e^{-0.25t}$.\n\nShow that $\\dfrac{dM}{dt}=-0.25M$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\dfrac{dM}{dt}=-0.25M$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}M&=80e^{-0.25t}\\\\\\frac{dM}{dt}&=80(-0.25)e^{-0.25t}\\\\&=-0.25\\left(80e^{-0.25t}\\right)\\\\&=-0.25M\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
